OL,3,GNEWSAHospital declares critical
OL,4,Aincident as beds full
OL,5,
OL,6,FA critical incident has been declared
OL,7,Fat a Kent hospital because of high
OL,8,Fpatient numbers.
OL,10,FEast Kent Hospitals NHS trust warned
OL,11,Fpeople going to the William Harvey
OL,12,FHospital, in Ashford, Kent, to be ready
OL,13,Ffor an "extremely long wait".
OL,15,FBeds across its hospitals were full, it
OL,16,Fsaid, adding its capacity to admit more
OL,17,Fpatients was limited.
OL,19,F"This decision has not been taken
OL,20,Flightly," a spokesman said.
